    "body": "I don't think there's anything formalized, but https://wiki.mozilla.org/Security/Anti_tracking_policy and https://webkit.org/tracking-prevention-policy/ come to mind as well as not introducing new same-origin policy violations, or adding features for which no meaningful end user consent can be obtained.",
